# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CATA-Net  —  .gitignore
# B. M. S. Islam  |  SeoulTech Masters Thesis
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Raw video files (too large for git, regenerate from source) ───────────────
dataset/bacarat_video.mp4
dataset/live_test_video/
videos/

# ── Image datasets (too large — download/regenerate locally) ──────────────────
dataset/image_data/card_datset/
dataset/image_data/yolo_dataset/

# ── Compressed crop datasets (regenerated by src/compress_crops.py) ───────────
dataset/image_data/card_datset_crf*/

# ── Cached MobileNet feature files (regenerated by src/featurize.py) ─────────
features/

# ── Trained model weights (large binaries) ────────────────────────────────────
models/*.pt
models/*.pth
models/*.engine
models/*.onnx
# keep the training history CSV (small, useful to track)
!models/classifier_history.csv

# ── Ultralytics training artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
runs/

# ── Ultralytics auto-downloaded pretrained weights (root level) ───────────────
yolo11n.pt
yolo11n.yaml
*.pt
!models/classifier_history.csv

# ── Large generated demo video ────────────────────────────────────────────────
dataset_report/demo_*.mp4
dataset_report/demo_*.avi

# ── Python cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python

# ── Jupyter ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
env/
.env
*.egg-info/

# ── OS / editor junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/settings.json
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Temporary files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tmp
*.log
tmp/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT IS TRACKED  (everything not listed above)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# src/                   all Python source code
# data/*.yaml            YOLO dataset config
# data/*.json            class name mappings
# data/video_inventory.csv
# data/tracks.csv        card track labels (output of track.py)
# data/detections.csv    per-frame detections
# results/               experiment result CSVs + plots
# dataset_report/*.png   data analysis figures (small)
# dataset_report/*.txt   text summary report
# models/classifier_history.csv
# additionals/           any extra scripts
# data_analysis.py
# .gitignore
# README.md
